{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_2", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_2.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "HOVSTAD", "names": ["HOVSTAD"], "gender": "m", "first": 33, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "And we have got a lamp-shade too.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you see?", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "All out of Katherine's savings!", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "It makes the room so cosy.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't you think so?", "para": 0, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Just stand here for a moment\u2014no, no, not there\u2014just here, that's it!", "para": 0, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Look now, when you get the light on it altogether.", "para": 0, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "I really think it looks very nice, doesn't it?", "para": 0, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, if you can afford luxuries of this kind\u2014", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I can afford it now.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Katherine tells me I earn almost as much as we spend.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Almost\u2014yes!", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "But a scientific man must live in a little bit of style.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "I am quite sure an ordinary civil servant spends more in a year than I do.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "I daresay.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "A civil servant\u2014a man in a well-paid position...", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, any ordinary merchant, then!", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "A man in that position spends two or three times as much as\u2014", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "It just depends on circumstances.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "At all events I assure you I don't waste money unprofitably.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "But I can't find it in my heart to deny myself the pleasure of entertaining my friends.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "I need that sort of thing, you know.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "I have lived for so long shut out of it all, that it is a necessity of life to me to mix with young, eager, ambitious men, men of liberal and active minds; and that describes every one of those fellows who are enjoying their supper in there.", "para": 8, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "I wish you knew more of Hovstad.", "para": 8, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "By the way, Hovstad was telling me he was going to print another article of yours.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "An article of mine?", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, about the Baths.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "An article you wrote in the winter.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, that one!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I don't intend that to appear just for the present.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Why not?", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "It seems to me that this would be the most opportune moment.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, very likely\u2014under normal conditions.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "(Crosses the room.)", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (following him with his eyes).", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Is there anything abnormal about the present conditions?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (standing still).", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "To tell you the truth, Peter, I can't say just at this moment\u2014at all events not tonight.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "There may be much that is very abnormal about the present conditions\u2014and it is possible there may be nothing abnormal about them at all.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "It is quite possible it may be merely my imagination.", "para": 16, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "I must say it all sounds most mysterious.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Is there something going on that I am to be kept in ignorance of?", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "I should have imagined that I, as Chairman of the governing body of the Baths\u2014", "para": 17, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "And I should have imagined that I\u2014.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, come, don't let us fly out at one another, Peter.", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Heaven forbid!", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "I am not in the habit of flying out at people, as you call it.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "But I am entitled to request most emphatically that all arrangements shall be made in a businesslike manner, through the proper channels, and shall be dealt with by the legally constituted authorities.", "para": 19, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "I can allow no going behind our backs by any roundabout means.", "para": 19, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Have I ever at any time tried to go behind your backs?", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "You have an ingrained tendency to take your own way, at all events; and, that is almost equally inadmissible in a well ordered community.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "The individual ought undoubtedly to acquiesce in subordinating himself to the community\u2014or, to speak more accurately, to the authorities who have the care of the community's welfare.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Very likely.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "But what the deuce has all this got to do with me?", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "That is exactly what you never appear to be willing to learn, my dear Thomas.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "But, mark my words, some day you will have to suffer for it\u2014sooner or later.", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Now I have told you.", "para": 23, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Good-bye.", "para": 23, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you taken leave of your senses?", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "You are on the wrong scent altogether.", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "I am not usually that.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "You must excuse me now if I\u2014 (calls into the dining-room).", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Good night, Katherine.", "para": 25, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Good night, gentlemen.", "para": 25, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes out.)", "para": 25, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (coming from the dining-room).", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Has he gone?", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and in such a bad temper.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "But, dear Thomas, what have you been doing to him again?", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Nothing at all.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "And, anyhow, he can't oblige me to make my report before the proper time.", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "What have you got to make a report to him about?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Leave that to me, Katherine.", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "It is an extraordinary thing that the postman doesn't come.", "para": 31, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "(HOVSTAD, BILLING and HORSTER have got up from the table and come into the sitting-room.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "EJLIF and MORTEN come in after them.)", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (stretching himself).", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah!\u2014one feels a new man after a meal like that.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "The mayor wasn't in a very sweet temper tonight, then.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "It is his stomach; he has wretched digestion.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "I rather think it was us two of the \"People's Messenger\" that he couldn't digest.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "I thought you came out of it pretty well with him.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh yes; but it isn't anything more than a sort of truce.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "That is just what it is!", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "That word sums up the situation.", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "We must remember that Peter is a lonely man, poor chap.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "He has no home comforts of any kind; nothing but everlasting business.", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "And all that infernal weak tea wash that he pours into himself!", "para": 40, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "Now then, my boys, bring chairs up to the table.", "para": 40, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 127, "kind": "action", "text": "Aren't we going to have that toddy, Katherine?", "para": 40, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 128, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (going into the dining-room).", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 129, "kind": "action", "text": "I am just getting it.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 130, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 131, "kind": "action", "text": "Sit down here on the couch beside me, Captain Horster.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 132, "kind": "action", "text": "We so seldom see you.", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 133, "kind": "action", "text": "Please sit down, my friends.", "para": 42, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 134, "kind": "action", "text": "(They sit down at the table.", "para": 42, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 135, "kind": "action", "text": "MRS. STOCKMANN brings a tray, with a spirit-lamp, glasses, bottles, etc., upon it.)", "para": 42, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 136, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 137, "kind": "action", "text": "There you are!", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 138, "kind": "action", "text": "This is arrack, and this is rum, and this one is the brandy.", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 139, "kind": "action", "text": "Now every one must help themselves.", "para": 43, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 140, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (taking a glass).", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 141, "kind": "action", "text": "We will.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 142, "kind": "action", "text": "(They all mix themselves some toddy.)", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 143, "kind": "action", "text": "And let us have the cigars.", "para": 44, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 144, "kind": "action", "text": "Ejlif, you know where the box is.", "para": 44, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 145, "kind": "action", "text": "And you, Morten, can fetch my pipe.", "para": 44, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 146, "kind": "action", "text": "(The two boys go into the room on the right.)", "para": 44, "sent": 6, "present": [0]}, {"u": 147, "kind": "action", "text": "I have a suspicion that Ejlif pockets a cigar now and then!\u2014but I take no notice of it.", "para": 44, "sent": 7, "present": [0]}, {"u": 148, "kind": "action", "text": "(Calls out.)", "para": 44, "sent": 8, "present": [0]}, {"u": 149, "kind": "action", "text": "And my smoking-cap too, Morten.", "para": 44, "sent": 9, "present": [0]}, {"u": 150, "kind": "action", "text": "Katherine, you can tell him where I left it.", "para": 44, "sent": 10, "present": [0]}, {"u": 151, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, he has got it.", "para": 44, "sent": 11, "present": [0]}, {"u": 152, "kind": "action", "text": "(The boys bring the various things.)", "para": 44, "sent": 12, "present": [0]}, {"u": 153, "kind": "action", "text": "Now, my friends.", "para": 44, "sent": 13, "present": [0]}, {"u": 154, "kind": "action", "text": "I stick to my pipe, you know.", "para": 44, "sent": 14, "present": [0]}, {"u": 155, "kind": "action", "text": "This one has seen plenty of bad weather with me up north.", "para": 44, "sent": 15, "present": [0]}, {"u": 156, "kind": "action", "text": "(Touches glasses with them.)", "para": 44, "sent": 16, "present": [0]}, {"u": 157, "kind": "action", "text": "Your good health!", "para": 44, "sent": 17, "present": [0]}, {"u": 158, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, it is good to be sitting snug and warm here.", "para": 44, "sent": 18, "present": [0]}]}